  "ingredients": [
    "1 (5 1/2 pound) boneless leg of lamb, tied in netting",
    "20 cloves garlic, peeled, or more to taste",
    "garlic powder, or to taste",
    "10 fresh rosemary sprigs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vhy904bj3HklpEXpwp84nU27GzI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230327-easy-leg-of-lamb-VAT-step-01-6eb1908732144193b8c15af93252a329.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230327/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut 20 deep slits evenly spaced around the leg of lamb without cutting the netting. Stuff one garlic clove into each slit.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/szPvCXQ6VGCVai7x_fboydcRC1Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230327-easy-leg-of-lamb-VAT-step-02-86079ebe771445dd8f462590bdf5badc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230327/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub garlic powder over lamb. Slice rosemary sprigs; place under the netting evenly around lamb. Transfer lamb to a roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/A1p9V2lWsJGenl64lA0U99i-u5g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230327-easy-leg-of-lamb-VAT-step-03-dd3ab5c1cc534ef1b58fc17d44e5a2d7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230327/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast lamb in the preheated oven until pink and juicy in the center for medium, about 2 to 2 ½ hours. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 130 degrees F (54 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RBAo6x8iLubEgYbIpDivc1kUrpI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230327-easy-leg-of-lamb-VAT-step-04-95c7bc9b74234c67bbbe6ef643e4f65d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230327/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and cover with aluminum foil; lest rest until thermometer reads 135 degrees F (57 degrees C) before carving, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F-VYyC6LIPi7uUJ3HZC6D8ATdsQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-230327-easy-leg-of-lamb-VAT-step-05-47381aee4f8a49c9b92608d201d7fa52.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230327/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
